[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the lifting bridge.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><strong>- 4450B80 cap of one wheel - r+r</strong></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237715\">1092E10</a></p><p>1. Unscrew fixing screws (1a) of counter-rotating shaft toothed\nbelt drive pulley (1b) and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014265.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit counter-rotating shaft toothed belt\ndrive pulley tensioner and fix it with its screws.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237715\">1092E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><strong>- 4450B80 cap of one wheel - r+r</strong></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237715\">1092E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Completely undo the nut (1a) loosened previously and remove the\ncounter-balance shaft drive belt tensioner (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014801.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the counter-balance shaft belt tensioner\nback in its housing and secure it without tightening the nut.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237715\">1092E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]